{"step_index":440,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-22T03:20:36Z","thinking":"Identified revenue data for two companies from the provided Excel file. Specifically, noted `북컬쳐(부산)`'s S24 revenue as `2,903,290,000` from a specific source, along with the corporate revenue figures of `영풍문고 신세계 센텀시티점`'s parent company for both 24 and 25 fiscal years, obtained from several sources. The latter is a branch, requiring linking the branch to its parent's revenue.\n\n\nAssessing the relevance of the \"ART 공시\" data and determining its proper placement (either in the designated column or the sales column) is necessary. Collected revenue data for multiple entities, including 교보문고 해운대 팝업스토어, 노블레스미디어인터내셔날부산, and others, referencing source documents. For companies already in the CSV, I need to add their source.\n\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"const fs = require('fs');\n\nfunction parseFullCSV(content) {\n  const rows = [];\n  let currentRow = [];\n  let currentField = '';\n  let inQuotes = false;\n  for (let i = 0; i < content.length; i++) {\n    const char = content[i];\n    const nextChar = content[i + 1];\n    if (char === '\"') {\n      if (inQuotes && nextChar === '\"') {\n        currentField += '\"';\n        i++;\n      } else {\n        inQuotes = !inQuotes;\n      }\n    } else if (char === ',' && !inQuotes) {\n      currentRow.push(currentField);\n      currentField = '';\n    } else if ((char === '\\r' || char === '\\n') && !inQuotes) {\n      if (char === '\\r' && nextChar === '\\n') i++;\n      currentRow.push(currentField);\n      if (currentRow.some(f => f.trim() !== '')) rows.push(currentRow);\n      currentRow = [];\n      currentField = '';\n    } else {\n      currentField += char;\n    }\n  }\n  if (currentField !== '' || currentRow.length > 0) {\n    currentRow.push(currentField);\n    if (currentRow.some(f => f.trim() !== '')) rows.push(currentRow);\n  }\n  return rows;\n}\n\nconst csvPath = 'C:/Users/lg/Desktop/Today/(안상숙)(STI)_(모집단현행화)_부산정보산업진흥원_2026_부산_CT산업_실태조사_260910_크레탑_배현명.csv';\nconst content = fs.readFileSync(csvPath, 'utf8');\nconst rows = parseFullCSV(content);\nconst header = rows[0];\nconst data = rows.slice(1);\n\nconsole.log('Total data rows:', data.length);\n\n// Missing sales\nconst missingSales = [];\ndata.forEach((r, idx) => {\n  const seq = r[1];\n  const name = r[2] ? r[2].trim() : '';\n  const biz = r[3] ? r[3].trim() : '';\n  const corp = r[4] ? r[4].trim() : '';\n  const ceo = r[7] ? r[7].trim() : '';\n  const phone = r[8] ? r[8].trim() : '';\n  const cat = r[12] ? r[12].trim() : '';\n  const s24 = r[16] ? r[16].trim() : '';\n  const s25 = r[17] ? r[17].trim() : '';\n  const note = r[18] ? r[18].trim() : '';\n\n  const hasSales = (s24 !== '' || s25 !== '');\n  if (!hasSales && biz !== '') {\n    // If it's a corporation or has corp number, or name has 주식회사/(주)\n    const isCorp = corp !== '' || name.includes('주식회사') || name.includes('(주)') || name.includes('유한회사') || name.includes('㈜');\n    missingSales.push({ idx: idx + 2, seq, name, biz, corp, ceo, cat, isCorp, note });\n  }\n});\n\nconsole.log('Missing sales with BizNo:', missingSales.length);\nconst corpsMissingSales = missingSales.filter(m => m.isCorp);\nconsole.log('Corporations missing sales:', corpsMissingSales.length);\n\nconsole.log('\\nTop 30 corporations missing sales:');\ncorpsMissingSales.slice(0, 30).forEach(c => {\n  console.log(`[Seq ${c.seq} / R${c.idx}] ${c.name} | Biz: ${c.biz} | CEO: ${c.ceo} | Cat: ${c.cat} | Note: ${c.note}`);\n});\n","Description":"List corporations missing sales figures","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\a97462f9-3976-4927-b799-281f20134eb3\\scratch\\find_missing_sales_corps.js","toolAction":"Writing script to find missing sales corps","toolSummary":"Create find_missing_sales_corps.js"}}]}
